WEBVTT

00:15.390 --> 00:16.891
BASED ON THE KINGDOM OF THE GODS BY YLAB

01:53.530 --> 01:55.115
As you ordered,

01:55.615 --> 01:57.575
all the gates have been sealed.

01:58.910 --> 01:59.911
However,

02:00.453 --> 02:03.414
do you really plan to give up
on the entire region of Gyeongsang?

02:04.124 --> 02:06.543
It doesn't compare to Jeolla,
lush and abundant,

02:06.918 --> 02:10.046
but do you really plan to give up
all the grains

02:10.588 --> 02:12.507
the subjects of Gyeongsang offer up?

02:16.761 --> 02:19.055
Do you regard power...

02:21.766 --> 02:24.185
only as a means of coveting money?

02:29.065 --> 02:30.441
How many dead bodies...

02:32.152 --> 02:34.279
do you think are
at the bottom of this pond?

02:36.406 --> 02:40.493
To bring the day
when no one can say a word about

02:41.077 --> 02:44.330
how many bodies I have dumped
in this pond.

02:45.707 --> 02:47.292
That is what power is for.

02:50.628 --> 02:51.713
I'll use that power...

02:53.047 --> 02:54.883
to protect you, Father.

02:55.466 --> 02:58.678
I'm the one
who placed that power in your hand.

03:01.139 --> 03:03.975
I'm also the one
who can take it away from you at any time.

03:07.520 --> 03:09.522
Do not open the gates

03:10.899 --> 03:12.817
until I give the orders.

03:18.948 --> 03:20.158
What about the Prince?

03:24.746 --> 03:28.625
The Crown Prince is still alive
in Gyeongsang.

03:30.251 --> 03:33.546
Do you plan to let him be?

03:40.970 --> 03:42.055
I'll...

03:44.140 --> 03:45.683
kill the Crown Prince.

03:48.478 --> 03:49.771
I'll...

03:51.648 --> 03:53.691
kill him with my own hands.

04:22.512 --> 04:23.429
Lord Ahn!

04:32.188 --> 04:33.690
Hand over the Crown Prince.

04:34.440 --> 04:37.110
Cho Hak-ju has closed Mungyeong Saejae.

04:37.694 --> 04:40.238
We need the Crown Prince
if we are to get it open again.

04:40.822 --> 04:42.282
Where is he?

04:48.288 --> 04:49.289
My lord,

04:49.998 --> 04:51.249
they have arrived.

04:55.336 --> 04:57.380
Sure, I'll grant your request.

04:58.423 --> 05:00.341
I'll let you take His Royal Highness.

05:09.892 --> 05:10.852
Your Royal Highness.

05:11.853 --> 05:13.604
You cannot trust anyone.

05:16.733 --> 05:18.192
We must leave this place.

05:23.323 --> 05:24.324
Your Royal Highness.

05:24.824 --> 05:27.702
Crown Prince Lee Chang, come out at once!

05:44.344 --> 05:45.970
You have come a long way.

05:47.722 --> 05:49.182
It's time to return to Hanyang.

06:03.321 --> 06:04.864
Are they not palace guards?

06:05.448 --> 06:07.116
Thank you for guarding the criminal.

06:08.576 --> 06:10.078
As per the King's command,

06:11.245 --> 06:12.747
I shall escort him to prison.

06:12.830 --> 06:14.540
Bind the traitor!

06:15.124 --> 06:16.209
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

06:16.918 --> 06:18.086
How dare you?

06:18.669 --> 06:19.629
Who?

06:20.671 --> 06:22.548
Who is the traitor?

06:24.801 --> 06:26.219
A palace guard,

06:27.470 --> 06:29.680
who should serve the nation and the King,

06:31.599 --> 06:35.019
gave into his personal greed
and became Cho Hak-ju's lapdog.

06:37.605 --> 06:40.233
For oppressing the Crown Prince,
the heir to the throne,

06:41.442 --> 06:44.153
and disrupting the core values
of this nation,

06:46.572 --> 06:47.865
you deserve to be executed.

06:50.118 --> 06:51.327
Execute him!

06:56.707 --> 06:58.126
What do you think you're doing?

07:13.099 --> 07:17.520
Sangju is my hometown
and where I currently reside.

07:18.813 --> 07:20.231
I urge you, Your Highness,

07:20.982 --> 07:22.483
to rest peacefully for tonight.

07:24.110 --> 07:25.945
There is no time to rest.

07:26.028 --> 07:27.238
You should rest

07:28.573 --> 07:30.366
and let your body recover.

07:30.867 --> 07:31.868
How else...

07:32.952 --> 07:36.330
will you fight the chief palace guard?

07:37.415 --> 07:39.167
What do you mean?

07:41.127 --> 07:42.211
Yesterday,

07:43.504 --> 07:46.340
a homing pigeon
delivered this secret letter

07:47.425 --> 07:48.759
from the chief palace guard.

07:50.803 --> 07:52.972
He said Your Royal Highness
was headed this way

07:54.515 --> 07:58.311
and that I should lock you up
until he arrives.

07:59.854 --> 08:01.731
The chief palace guard
couldn't have known

08:02.398 --> 08:03.941
that I was headed here.

08:08.738 --> 08:10.281
One of your companions...

08:11.282 --> 08:14.118
is Cho Hak-ju's mole.

08:15.244 --> 08:16.120
Thus,

08:17.705 --> 08:22.335
you must not let anyone know
what we just discussed.

08:36.265 --> 08:40.311
None of you shall survive.
Not a single one.

08:41.812 --> 08:45.566
Not only you but your families...

08:47.985 --> 08:50.571
will be trapped in Gyeongsang,

08:51.989 --> 08:54.116
catch the disease, and be decapitated.

09:02.917 --> 09:04.168
What have you just done?

09:04.252 --> 09:07.004
How could you massacre guards
delivering the King's command?

09:07.088 --> 09:09.632
Do you think Lord Cho Hak-ju
will let you get away?

09:11.133 --> 09:12.426
He'll accuse you of treason

09:12.510 --> 09:16.055
- and turn Sangju into a bloodbath!
- Cho Hak-ju has already abandoned Sangju.

09:16.764 --> 09:19.350
He's abandoned Sangju
and the east and west regions

09:19.725 --> 09:21.978
of Gyeongsang and the people therein.

09:22.895 --> 09:23.938
What do you mean?

09:24.522 --> 09:25.898
Do you think those soldiers

09:26.274 --> 09:28.568
blocked off Mungyeong Saejae
just to stop me?

09:32.822 --> 09:35.241
My lord, we have a big problem.

09:51.799 --> 09:54.468
Yangsan, Gyeongju, Daegu,
Hapcheon, Changnyeong...

09:54.844 --> 09:58.264
They came from various parts
of the south to escape the epidemic.

09:59.098 --> 10:01.475
All of them were hit by the epidemic?

10:01.559 --> 10:03.853
If Changnyeong was hit,
the infected will get here

10:03.978 --> 10:05.229
in two days

10:05.771 --> 10:07.273
or as soon as tonight.

10:08.858 --> 10:11.360
You must open the gate and let them in.

10:11.444 --> 10:13.195
If all parts of Gyeongsang were hit,

10:13.696 --> 10:15.364
there will be more refugees.

10:15.448 --> 10:19.160
How are we going to house
and feed them all?

10:19.452 --> 10:21.662
Once we run out of food,
they will start looting.

10:21.746 --> 10:23.331
There will be mayhem.

10:23.414 --> 10:26.667
Then do you plan to sit back
and watch them die?

10:39.513 --> 10:40.765
If you don't open the gate,

10:40.848 --> 10:43.351
the people outside the fortress
will be put in danger.

10:43.434 --> 10:44.393
Open the gate.

10:45.478 --> 10:47.104
We cannot open the gate.

10:48.147 --> 10:50.066
At least the people inside must survive.

10:51.901 --> 10:55.196
I'm sure Cho Hak-ju said the same thing
when he closed Mungyeong Saejae.

10:56.489 --> 10:57.948
That at least they must survive.

10:58.532 --> 11:00.409
This is a sacrifice
for the greater good.

11:01.035 --> 11:03.454
Who are you to decide whom to sacrifice?

11:04.413 --> 11:07.416
If you lock the gate, those outside
will catch the disease and die.

11:07.625 --> 11:10.461
The people inside will be trapped
and die of starvation.

11:12.380 --> 11:14.006
I'm the magistrate of Sangju!

11:14.090 --> 11:15.132
No.

11:15.925 --> 11:18.135
You are no longer qualified
to run this place.

11:18.886 --> 11:19.720
What?

11:19.804 --> 11:22.723
cannot let everyone die
because of an incompetent official.

11:23.099 --> 11:26.143
I'll protect Sangju and the people
from now on.

11:27.561 --> 11:29.021
By what right?

11:31.732 --> 11:33.234
I'm the Crown Prince.

11:35.277 --> 11:37.405
I strip you of the title
from this moment!

11:39.990 --> 11:41.575
It's the Crown Prince's command.

11:42.201 --> 11:43.411
Escort the magistrate out.

11:43.494 --> 11:44.787
Lord Ahn,

11:45.621 --> 11:47.039
you cannot do this.

11:48.582 --> 11:50.126
You will regret this.

11:55.047 --> 11:56.048
Move aside!

12:01.387 --> 12:02.388
What will you do?

12:03.222 --> 12:04.974
Even if we open the gate,

12:05.599 --> 12:08.561
the fortress is not spacious enough
to shelter the refugees

12:09.437 --> 12:10.938
as well as the people outside.

12:11.939 --> 12:13.274
You are correct.

12:14.442 --> 12:16.485
It cannot house everyone.

12:18.529 --> 12:19.989
If we are to save everyone,

12:20.740 --> 12:22.742
we must protect the entire Sangju.

12:23.325 --> 12:25.494
The infected will soon come charging in.

12:26.328 --> 12:27.830
How can we protect Sangju?

12:30.499 --> 12:33.627
The diseased are corpses during the day
and come alive only at night.

12:33.711 --> 12:35.212
They also fear water and fire.

12:36.380 --> 12:38.549
If we take advantage of that,
we can stop them.

12:45.681 --> 12:49.185
The south of Sangju
is surrounded by water.

12:51.145 --> 12:53.022
If we guard both Byeongseong Stream

12:54.023 --> 12:55.649
and Unpo Wetland against them,

12:56.233 --> 12:57.485
we all can...

12:59.195 --> 13:00.654
survive.

14:03.050 --> 14:06.303
You cannot do this.
How could you tell noblemen to bear arms?

14:06.387 --> 14:07.596
This is nonsense.

14:08.013 --> 14:09.473
It's the Crown Prince's command.

14:13.978 --> 14:16.730
We should be holding books,
not something like this.

15:44.485 --> 15:46.737
Okay, a little more.

15:48.781 --> 15:49.907
Okay, you should go.

15:53.994 --> 15:55.537
I'll check the perimeter.

16:12.304 --> 16:14.306
I think the baby will be born today.

16:15.599 --> 16:17.643
- Will it be a boy?
- We are not sure--

16:17.726 --> 16:19.979
Report to me only when a baby boy is born.

16:20.396 --> 16:21.647
Yes, Your Majesty.

16:45.504 --> 16:47.464
Mom!

16:54.513 --> 16:55.472
The baby is here!

16:55.556 --> 16:58.559
Thank goodness. She has been
in so much pain since last night.

16:58.642 --> 17:01.937
I know. It must have been so hard for her.

17:20.122 --> 17:22.332
It's cold outside. Return to your rooms.

17:22.416 --> 17:25.794
The baby is not crying.
Is something wrong?

17:27.713 --> 17:29.548
Both the mother and the baby are safe.

17:29.923 --> 17:33.427
She is nursing the baby now, so go back.

17:37.639 --> 17:40.267
Is it a boy or a girl?

17:42.936 --> 17:44.146
It's a girl.

17:44.730 --> 17:47.399
- Gosh.
- Why does it have to be a girl?

17:47.483 --> 17:49.151
Who cares if it's a girl?

17:49.234 --> 17:51.153
It doesn't matter,
if the baby is healthy.

18:18.764 --> 18:20.682
Darn it. Oh, no.

18:20.766 --> 18:21.850
You are so...

18:27.856 --> 18:29.983
Thank goodness.

18:30.317 --> 18:32.528
It did not damage Her Majesty's robe.

18:32.611 --> 18:33.445
Thank goodness.

18:34.029 --> 18:37.074
If you had left a stain on it,
it would have turned into ashes.

18:37.449 --> 18:38.700
What do you mean?

18:39.118 --> 18:40.577
One time,

18:41.203 --> 18:43.831
I saw them burning
Her Majesty's precious silk robe.

18:45.082 --> 18:47.626
- Really?
- Yes, for real.

18:47.793 --> 18:50.462
The head court lady burned it herself.

18:50.963 --> 18:53.841
It only had a tiny blood stain on it.

18:54.591 --> 18:55.717
What a waste.

18:56.593 --> 18:57.636
My gosh.

18:58.095 --> 19:01.265
I could die a happy girl
if I could wear something like this once.

19:02.182 --> 19:04.476
What could lowly girls like us
possibly expect?

19:06.270 --> 19:07.396
We shall go.

19:07.980 --> 19:08.981
Okay.

19:17.739 --> 19:19.408
- Your Majesty.
- Your Majesty.

19:23.620 --> 19:25.247
If you're done, you may leave.

19:25.581 --> 19:26.874
- Yes, my lady.
- Yes, my lady.

19:46.685 --> 19:47.811
My lady,

19:48.437 --> 19:51.148
will I really serve Her Majesty?

19:51.857 --> 19:54.484
Why someone lowly like me,
instead of a court lady?

19:55.068 --> 19:57.613
Do not speak and focus on
serving Her Majesty.

20:27.226 --> 20:28.727
Why are you so slow?

20:28.810 --> 20:29.978
Apologies, Your Majesty.

20:52.834 --> 20:53.919
How dare you?

21:15.857 --> 21:17.192
What do you think?

21:18.026 --> 21:20.529
My baby looks very healthy, does he not?

21:26.493 --> 21:28.036
Please have mercy, Your Majesty!

21:56.189 --> 21:59.109
- I shall carry that for you.
- There is no need. Just go.

22:06.700 --> 22:07.826
What do you think?

22:09.202 --> 22:10.787
This is plenty, is it not?

22:29.139 --> 22:30.766
You are incredible.

22:32.517 --> 22:35.896
How did you pick nothing but weeds?

22:35.979 --> 22:37.022
What?

22:38.023 --> 22:41.318
What? Look closely.

22:41.777 --> 22:43.653
I only picked what you told me to pick.

22:44.196 --> 22:47.866
You must be tired. You should rest.

22:47.949 --> 22:49.201
But...

22:49.576 --> 22:51.912
I'll go and pick it myself.

22:51.995 --> 22:54.664
But... what do you mean I should rest?

22:57.292 --> 22:59.419
How can a man rest
when everyone is working?

23:00.212 --> 23:01.088
Seo-bi!

23:01.755 --> 23:05.092
Is that not more than enough?

23:06.301 --> 23:09.221
There are more medicinal herbs
that I must find.

23:09.471 --> 23:12.265
What more are you looking for?

23:13.475 --> 23:14.810
False lily of the valley.

23:15.018 --> 23:17.521
His Royal Highness's wounds
have not healed yet.

23:18.188 --> 23:19.898
I need that plant.

23:21.316 --> 23:23.276
So, it's for the Crown Prince.

23:26.613 --> 23:27.781
Seo-bi.

23:28.782 --> 23:29.825
Seo-bi.

23:30.951 --> 23:32.953
I'm hurt as well.

23:33.453 --> 23:36.790
You got hurt while running away.

23:42.629 --> 23:44.297
No... You...

23:44.381 --> 23:46.383
You cannot go that way.

23:47.092 --> 23:49.386
The magistrate's office
said that path is dangerous

23:49.970 --> 23:52.305
and strictly forbids entering it.

23:53.640 --> 23:55.725
It's not like there are tigers there.

23:55.809 --> 23:57.978
What is dangerous about it?

23:58.353 --> 24:00.480
Who knows? It's called Frozen Valley.

24:00.564 --> 24:02.691
Maybe it's haunted or something.

24:02.774 --> 24:04.776
We should go back.

24:06.153 --> 24:07.696
What did you just say?

24:07.779 --> 24:09.322
What? What do you mean?

24:10.782 --> 24:12.492
Did you say, "Frozen Valley"?

24:13.201 --> 24:14.202
Yes.

24:14.369 --> 24:16.913
That valley up there is
called Frozen Valley.

24:22.836 --> 24:24.963
Wait...

24:25.380 --> 24:28.633
Why is she so fearless?

24:29.718 --> 24:30.677
Well,

24:31.678 --> 24:33.430
that is her charm.

24:34.055 --> 24:34.890
Seo-bi.

24:41.897 --> 24:44.316
Wait, Seo-bi.

25:17.265 --> 25:20.727
It's chilly.
It already feels like winter here.

25:24.481 --> 25:27.025
A place where it's foggy
all year round...

25:32.239 --> 25:34.407
Wait, Seo-bi.

25:35.784 --> 25:37.244
Hold on.

25:40.038 --> 25:41.289
Seo-bi!

25:43.375 --> 25:44.417
Seo-bi.

26:03.061 --> 26:04.229
It's too cold!

26:05.021 --> 26:06.022
It's so cold!

26:20.287 --> 26:21.705
The resurrection plant...

26:24.749 --> 26:26.585
What did you say?

26:30.714 --> 26:32.132
This is the plant.

26:34.259 --> 26:36.511
This plant brought the dead back to life.

26:38.847 --> 26:41.224
This is the plant
that brought the dead back to life!

26:53.028 --> 26:54.821
What is that?

27:25.477 --> 27:26.645
When aiming a gun,

27:27.437 --> 27:30.065
you must keep the muzzle, the barrel,
and the arm straight

27:30.148 --> 27:31.149
as much as you can.

27:32.192 --> 27:33.777
He is good with guns.

27:34.402 --> 27:35.779
He was a member of Chakho.

27:38.198 --> 27:40.241
He's the one from Sumang Village
I spoke of.

27:50.543 --> 27:51.795
Fire!

27:55.173 --> 27:56.341
Do you know him?

27:58.510 --> 27:59.552
No.

28:00.637 --> 28:02.013
I do not know him.

28:10.021 --> 28:10.939
Fire!

28:17.737 --> 28:19.572
Everyone, listen up!

28:19.656 --> 28:21.449
The sun will set soon!

28:22.117 --> 28:24.411
Check your surroundings one more time!

28:24.994 --> 28:28.415
Do not leave your post for any reason!

28:29.124 --> 28:30.291
Do you understand?

28:30.375 --> 28:31.376
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

28:36.715 --> 28:38.133
Cast off the boats!

28:38.633 --> 28:43.054
...two! One! Two!

28:43.722 --> 28:44.681
One!

28:45.640 --> 28:46.891
Two!

29:22.761 --> 29:25.138
The ones who went on reconnaissance
haven't returned.

30:10.642 --> 30:11.810
We have arrived, my lord.

30:29.994 --> 30:31.412
THE GATE OF MUNGYEONG SAEJAE

30:31.496 --> 30:32.747
Welcome, Chief Councillor.

30:41.422 --> 30:42.632
What is the status?

30:42.966 --> 30:44.801
Sangju is still safe from the epidemic.

31:17.458 --> 31:18.585
Your Royal Highness.

31:20.044 --> 31:22.922
The sun will rise and we only need
to hang on a little longer.

31:31.973 --> 31:32.932
Your Royal Highness.

32:02.128 --> 32:04.505
It's the horse of the servant
who was out on survey.

32:05.715 --> 32:06.591
Let it through.

32:45.964 --> 32:47.882
The blood has not dried yet.

32:50.009 --> 32:51.678
They will be here soon.

33:14.742 --> 33:16.536
The signal fire is lit.
Sound the drums!

34:05.960 --> 34:07.462
Please, rise.

34:23.352 --> 34:24.812
It's very cold outside.

34:25.271 --> 34:26.481
Get inside, my lord.

35:08.940 --> 35:11.025
- It's the sun!
- The sun is up!

35:32.046 --> 35:33.506
We must prepare for tonight,

35:33.756 --> 35:35.508
so I'll tell them to get some rest.

35:40.054 --> 35:41.722
Everyone, come in!

35:41.806 --> 35:44.433
- We made it!
- Let us pull out for today!

35:55.987 --> 35:59.448
- One, two. One, two.
- One, two. One, two.

36:00.867 --> 36:04.162
Now that the sun has risen,
let us get some sleep.

36:04.245 --> 36:05.830
Let us eat some delicious food!

36:05.997 --> 36:06.914
Let us go.

36:16.299 --> 36:18.259
Do you think it's over?

36:21.012 --> 36:24.182
Pack up quickly,
and prepare for the evening!

36:24.265 --> 36:25.433
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

37:04.263 --> 37:06.849
How are they out during the day?

37:12.063 --> 37:15.024
It was not the sun.

37:17.109 --> 37:18.611
It was the temperature.

43:09.461 --> 43:11.505
Subtitle translation by Jeong Lee
